From 3fb18470ece076b4165593b1828760a1ad166b58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HyperFlux Next Source Transformer <noreply@hyperflux.dev>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 21:29:19 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add trusted HyperFlux native HID transport

Carry the Arch Linux hid_report_raw_event compatibility condition for newer kernels and deploy udev access through the openrazer group.
---
